cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the preprint."
title: "MalnuPK: mechanism-constrained deep learning for pharmacokinetics under undernutrition and water-toxicant co-exposure"
abstract: >-
  A generative simulator in which nutritional status and drinking-water toxicant
  exposure jointly determine the pharmacokinetics of nine essential medicines,
  and a mechanism-constrained neural model that recovers individual
  pharmacokinetic parameters from bedside-observable covariates.
type: software
